{
  "format": 1,
  "id": "pcb-eagle",
  "name": "Circuit board: EAGLE",
  "version": "1.0.0",
  "min_base": "1.6.0",
  "author": "Michał Sarna",
  "license": "MIT OR Apache-2.0",
  "description": "Reads an EAGLE or Fusion Electronics board (.brd, XML): the board outline (Dimension layer), copper (wires, pads, SMD pads, vias), drill holes and the silkscreen, each part ticked in the form. Copper pours are left out. For isolation milling, laser engraving of a resist or plotting of the traces.",
  "importers": [
    {
      "id": "eagle-brd",
      "name": "EAGLE board (.brd)",
      "extensions": [
        "brd"
      ],
      "script": "read.rhai",
      "params": [
        {
          "id": "outline",
          "label": "Board outline (Dimension)",
          "kind": "bool",
          "default": true
        },
        {
          "id": "copper_top",
          "label": "Copper on top",
          "kind": "bool",
          "default": true
        },
        {
          "id": "copper_bottom",
          "label": "Copper on the bottom",
          "kind": "bool",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "id": "holes",
          "label": "Drill holes",
          "kind": "bool",
          "default": true
        },
        {
          "id": "legend_top",
          "label": "Legend on top",
          "kind": "bool",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "id": "legend_bottom",
          "label": "Legend on the bottom",
          "kind": "bool",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "id": "mirror",
          "label": "Mirror (a bottom layer seen from the top)",
          "kind": "bool",
          "default": false
        },
        {
          "id": "origin",
          "label": "Origin",
          "kind": "choice",
          "default": "Board corner to the top left",
          "options": [
            "As in the file",
            "Board corner to the top left"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "mode",
          "label": "Copper drawn as",
          "kind": "choice",
          "default": "Outlines grown by the isolation",
          "options": [
            "Centre lines",
            "Outlines grown by the isolation"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "isolation",
          "label": "Isolation",
          "kind": "number",
          "default": 0.2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 5,
          "unit": "mm"
        },
        {
          "id": "holes_as",
          "label": "Holes drawn as",
          "kind": "choice",
          "default": "Circles of the real size",
          "options": [
            "Circles of the real size",
            "Small circles at the centres"
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "layer_outline",
          "label": "Layer of the board outline",
          "kind": "number",
          "default": 0,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 20,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "layer_copper",
          "label": "Layer of the copper",
          "kind": "number",
          "default": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 20,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "layer_holes",
          "label": "Layer of the drill holes",
          "kind": "number",
          "default": 2,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 20,
          "unit": ""
        },
        {
          "id": "layer_legend",
          "label": "Layer of the legend",
          "kind": "number",
          "default": 3,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 20,
          "unit": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "texts": {
    "pl": {
      "Mirror (a bottom layer seen from the top)": "Odbicie lustrzane (warstwa spodnia widziana od góry)",
      "Origin": "Początek układu",
      "As in the file": "Jak w pliku",
      "Board corner to the top left": "Narożnik płytki w lewym górnym rogu",
      "Copper drawn as": "Miedź rysowana jako",
      "Centre lines": "Linie środkowe",
      "Outlines grown by the isolation": "Kontury powiększone o izolację",
      "Isolation": "Izolacja",
      "Holes drawn as": "Otwory rysowane jako",
      "Circles of the real size": "Okręgi w prawdziwym rozmiarze",
      "Small circles at the centres": "Małe okręgi w środkach",
      "Layer of the board outline": "Warstwa obrysu płytki",
      "Layer of the copper": "Warstwa miedzi",
      "Layer of the drill holes": "Warstwa otworów",
      "Layer of the legend": "Warstwa opisu (sitodruk)",
      "Copper on top": "Miedź na wierzchu",
      "Copper on the bottom": "Miedź na spodzie",
      "Drill holes": "Otwory wiercone",
      "Legend on top": "Opis na wierzchu",
      "Legend on the bottom": "Opis na spodzie",
      "Board outline (Dimension)": "Obrys płytki (Dimension)",
      "Circuit board: EAGLE": "Płytka drukowana: EAGLE",
      "EAGLE board (.brd)": "Płytka EAGLE (.brd)",
      "Reads an EAGLE or Fusion Electronics board (.brd, XML): the board outline (Dimension layer), copper (wires, pads, SMD pads, vias), drill holes and the silkscreen, each part ticked in the form. Copper pours are left out. For isolation milling, laser engraving of a resist or plotting of the traces.": "Czyta płytkę z EAGLE lub Fusion Electronics (.brd, XML): obrys płytki (warstwa Dimension), miedź (ścieżki, pady, pady SMD, przelotki), otwory i sitodruk — każdą część zaznaczasz w formularzu. Wylewki miedzi są pomijane. Do frezowania izolacji, wypalania maski laserem lub rysowania ścieżek."
    }
  }
}
